{'symbol': 'STX', 'date': '2022-11-14 21:48:00', 'title': 'SEAGATE ANNOUNCES EXCHANGE OFFERS FOR CERTAIN OUTSTANDING DEBT SECURITIES', 'text': "FREMONT, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--SEAGATE HDD CAYMAN (THE “COMPANY”), A SUBSIDIARY OF SEAGATE TECHNOLOGY HOLDINGS PLC (NASDAQ: STX), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMMENCEMENT OF EXCHANGE OFFERS (EACH, AN “EXCHANGE OFFER” AND TOGETHER, THE “EXCHANGE OFFERS”) TO CERTAIN ELIGIBLE HOLDERS OF THE COMPANY'S OUTSTANDING DEBT SECURITIES LISTED IN THE TABLE BELOW (TOGETHER, THE “EXISTING NOTES” AND EACH A “SERIES” OF EXISTING NOTES) TO EXCHANGE EXISTING NOTES FOR UP TO $500 MILLION IN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF THE COMPANY'S 9.625% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2032 (THE “NEW NOTES”). THE COMPLETE TERMS OF THE NEW NOTES ARE SET FORTH IN A CONFIDENTIAL OFFERING MEMORANDUM, DATED TODAY (THE “OFFERING MEMORANDUM”), AND THE RELATED LETTER OF TRANSMITTAL, DATED TODAY (TOGETHER WITH THE OFFERING MEMORANDUM, THE “OFFERING DOCUMENTS”)."}{'symbol': 'STX', 'date': '2022-11-14 14:45:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF SEAGATE TECHNOLOGY HOLDINGS PLC - STX', 'text': 'NEW YORK , NOV. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF\xa0SEAGATE TECHNOLOGY HOLDINGS PLC\xa0("SEAGATE" OR THE "COMPANY")\xa0(NASDAQ:\xa0STX).\xa0 SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S.'}